        "subject": "LU-19743 tests: Allow multiple FID formats on debugfs tests",
        "message": "LU-19743 tests: Allow multiple FID formats on debugfs tests\n\nSince new debugfs FID output will not output brace in the future,\nrelated tests must support both DFID and DFID_NOBRACE format FIDs\nfor test interop compatibility.\n\nLustre-change: https://review.whamcloud.com/63195\nLustre-commit: e1f272796c51f5335b03f5d60a626ef90ec4d1d7\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Aurélien Cedeyn <acedeyn@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: I9c78b051091307eba4760d3220c0caf3d0056efa\nReviewed-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nReviewed-by: Alex Deiter <adeiter@ddn.com>\nReviewed-by: Li Dongyang <dongyangli@ddn.com>\n"
